{"Title":"An Act renaming the Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts","BillNumber":"S2766","DocketNumber":"SD2960","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-16T08:56:24.823"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-16T08:56:24.84"},{"Id":"NMB1","Name":"Natalie M. Blais","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NMB1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-21T15:50:27.04"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2766/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Mark, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2766) (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Paul W. Mark and Natalie M. Blais for legislation to rename the Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts.  Environment and Natural Resources.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 89 of Chapter 209 of the Acts of 2018  is hereby amended by striking out, wherever they appear, the words “Mohawk Trail Woodlands Partnership” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- \"Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts\" and;\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 91 of Chapter 209 of the Acts of 2018  is hereby amended by striking out, wherever they appear, the words “Mohawk Trail Woodlands Partnership” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- \"Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts\" and;\r\n\tSECTION 3. Chapter 279 of the Acts of 2018 is hereby amended by striking out, wherever they appear, the words “Mohawk Trail Woodlands Partnership” and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- \"Woodlands Partnership of Northwest Massachusetts\".\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Adverse","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J21","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J21"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J21","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J21"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2766","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2766/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"}]}